  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic recovery and transformation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic growth, poverty reduction and sustainable development have suffered major setbacks due to the COVID-19 pandemic. Our economic recovery and transformation team wants to contribute to effective European and African policies and instruments for a sustainable and inclusive economic recovery and transformation in Africa.Topics we look at include:Private sector development, trade and investment in Europe-Africa relationsThe European financial architecture for development and EU sustainable corporate governance legislation &#x2013; and their impact on African countriesCircular economyWomen&#x2019;s economic empowerment</narrative>
  </description>
